<title>UK: Enterprise Oil appoints Jungels as new head.</title>
<headline>Enterprise Oil appoints Jungels as new head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Enterprise Oil Plc said on Tuesday it had appointed Pierre Jungels as chief executive with effect from January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Jungels is currently managing director of exploration and production at British Gas, oil exploration and production company Enterprise said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Graham Hearne would continue as chairman of the group while Mike Pink would retire as group managing director.</p>
</text>
